/* =====================================================================
   JAHIZOUN MBA TRACKER — DATA FILE
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   This is the ONLY file you need to edit to update the dashboard.
   Easiest way: open the dashboard, switch on Edit mode, make your changes,
   click "Copy data.js", then paste over this file on GitHub and commit.

   HOW TO READ THIS FILE
   - Every candidate is one object inside CANDIDATES.
   - programme: "Jahizoun" or "EDGE". Teams (Executive Office function) are only shown for Jahizoun.
   - photo: a path inside /photos (e.g. "photos/saoud-alkaabi.jpg") or an embedded image
            added through Edit mode. Leave "" while there is no picture yet.
   - intake: the MBA class the candidate is applying for.
   - test: admission test score, e.g. "GMAT 665" or "EA 162" (Executive Assessment). "" if none yet.
   - applications: one entry per school. "status" must be one of the STATUS keys below.
   - interview.date: "YYYY-MM-DD" (or a list "2026-09-15, 2026-09-16").
                     Leave "" when no interview is scheduled — the dashboard shows "Pending".
   ===================================================================== */

